Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.95,Default,,60,60,0,,The biggest financial\Nlie you’ve ever been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:05.89,Default,,60,60,0,,sold? That saving\Nalone makes you rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:08.84,Default,,60,60,0,,You’ve been meticulously\Nstashing cash for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:11.79,Default,,60,60,0,,watching it slowly\Naccumulate. But here’s the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:14.73,Default,,60,60,0,,brutal truth: that\Nmoney is silently eroding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:17.68,Default,,60,60,0,,Inflation, a silent\Nthief, steals its value.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.63,Default,,60,60,0,,A dollar saved\Nin 2000 is worth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.58,Default,,60,60,0,,40% less today. Your\Nsavings account offers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:26.52,Default,,60,60,0,,meager 0.5% interest,\Nwhile inflation often rages
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:29.47,Default,,60,60,0,,at 3% or more.\NThis isn't building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:32.42,Default,,60,60,0,,wealth; it’s a slow\Nfinancial bleed. You're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:35.36,Default,,60,60,0,,losing purchasing power,\Ntrapped in diminishing returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:38.31,Default,,60,60,0,,To truly build\Nfortune, you MUST make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:41.26,Default,,60,60,0,,your money work.\NInvest it. Unleash its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:44.20,Default,,60,60,0,,potential. Are you\Nready to stop your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.47,Default,,60,60,0,,future from shrinking?